00:13:05,070 --> 00:13:12,324
It helps teams communicate, create separate channels for different projects, share files, and keep everything organized in one place.

196
00:13:12,942 --> 00:13:18,140
Pretty useful when you're working with a team and don't want important messages getting lost between different conversations.

197
00:13:19,054 --> 00:13:20,680
So here's what we're going to try.

