We want to actually send messages, create channels, and interact with the app.

201
00:13:32,878 --> 00:13:34,100
Let's see how close we can get.

202
00:13:34,830 --> 00:13:39,172
First, open DeepSeek harness and make sure our open router preset is selected.

203
00:13:39,950 --> 00:13:45,760
Now, in the chat box, we're going to give DeepSeek a detailed prompt explaining exactly what we want to build.

204
