We'll ask it to use Slack's publicly visible interface as a reference, but with our own name and branding.

206
00:13:54,380 --> 00:14:01,680
We want the familiar purple sidebar, different channels, direct messages, a messaging area, and a search bar.

207
00:14:02,222 --> 00:14:08,700
And of course, working features like sending messages, creating channels, replying in threads, and sharing files.

208
00:14:09,326 --> 00:14:16,380
We'll also ask it to pay attention to the smaller details, like spacing, icons, and how the buttons respond when we click them.

